WEBVTT

00:16:00.095 --> 00:16:02.006
svojih ekonomskih resursa,

00:16:02.245 --> 00:16:04.314
bore se protiv nejednakosti

00:16:04.587 --> 00:16:06.930
zagovaranjem socijalne politike

00:16:06.973 --> 00:16:11.246
ali koji ce mozda na kraju vratiti&lt;/br&gt;sjaj Americkog sna.

00:16:07.163 --> 00:16:11.528
promjene u drustvenim vrijednostima,

00:16:11.246 --> 00:16:13.246
Hvala.

00:16:11.808 --> 00:16:15.066
i promjene u ljudskom ponasanju,

00:16:13.246 --> 00:16:17.246
(Aplauz)

00:16:14.141 --> 00:16:18.141
koje rade protiv njihovih ekonomskih interesa